4.2. Previous results on Maximal Incoherent Subsets. Before we prove our results
on maximal incoherent subsets of equiangular lines, we mention some previous work on this
topic. In [52] Taylor investigated maximal coherent sets of (regular) two-graphs. His results
are relevant for our purposes because any maximal coherent set of a two-graph is a maximal
incoherent set of the complementary two-graph. We present his results (in the language
