design with exactly two block intersection numbers, that is there exist integers s1 , s2 such
that all pairs of distinct blocks have exactly s1 or s2 elements in common. We refer to such
a design as a t-(n, k, λ; s1 , s2 ) design. These designs have been studied extensively due to
their connections with strongly regular graphs.
