             10. On the Existence of Certain Quasi-symmetric designs
  By Theorem 1.3, the problem of classifying all sets of equiangular lines that saturate
both the relative bound and the incoherence bound is equivalent to classifying the quasi-
symmetric designs with the parameters given in the theorem. By Remark 6.7, this is the
same as the following two problems.
Problem 10.1. Classify all 2-(d(s1 , s2 ), k(s1 , s2 ), λ(s1 , s2 ); s1 , s2 ) quasi-symmetric designs
where d(s1 , s2 ), k(s1 , s2 ), and λ(s1 , s2 ) are given in Remark 6.7.
