Problem 10.2. Classify all 2-(2i(2i + 1) − 1, (2i − 1)(i + 1), i(2i2 + i − 2); i2 + i − 1, i2 − 1)
quasi-symmetric design, for integers i ⩾ 1.
   It is actually straightforward to show that we only need consider the designs in Problem
10.1 up to complementarity.
