will see in the last column, labelled “Existence", that we have been able to discard some
of these remaining parameter sets, mainly as a consequence of the theorems of Calderbank
mentioned above. Upon examination of Table 4, three families of parameters seem worth
highlighting. For a positive integer i, the parameters for each family can be found in one
of the columns of Table 3. In Table 5 we have recorded the parameters of the (possible)
quasi-symmetric designs, and corresponding sets of lines, for the first 10 values of i for each
family.
