The first corrected escalation is active at `q=17` with the degree still fixed at seven. Its first oracle failed, so this is the first rung showing possible hardness; two attempts remain.
diff --git a/results/1809.05739/gen_1809_05739.py b/results/1809.05739/gen_1809_05739.py
