codex
The new fixed-operation-count rung is active at prime `q≈10^6`, with every class still between 11 and 23 lines and the certificate still degree 7. This isolates arithmetic range from route length.
diff --git a/results/1809.05739/gen_1809_05739.py b/results/1809.05739/gen_1809_05739.py
