Implemented and verified a native geometric Track B generator based on Section 6 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1809.05739).

Key results:

- All G1–G9 gates pass.
- Bare hardening verdict: `hardened` at \(q=1{,}000{,}003\), 0/3 solved.
- Structural and placebo arms: both 0/3 solved.
- Structure-aware guessing: 0/200,000.
- Reference algorithm: 222,948,182 exact operations, 19.33 seconds.
- Intended decomposition route: 884 operations.
- Answer: 382 characters, approximately 96 tokens, 32 atoms.

